<title>USA: GOLF-UNITED STATES RETAIN PRESIDENTS CUP OVER INTERNATIONAL TEAM.</title>
<headline>GOLF-UNITED STATES RETAIN PRESIDENTS CUP OVER INTERNATIONAL TEAM.</headline>
<dateline>GAINESVILLE, Va.</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States retained the</p>
<p>Presidents Cup by beating the International team 16 1/2 to 15</p>
<p>1/2 on Sunday in the match play competition at Lake Manassas.</p>
</text>
